# n8n SEO Blog Automation Workflow

## Overview
Automated keyword research → content generation via WriteSeed → HTML creation → GitHub push workflow for SEO blog ranking.

## Workflow Steps

### Stage 1: Keyword Research (Free - Google AI Studio Gemini API)
- **Trigger**: Manual or scheduled (e.g., 3x/week)
- **Input**: Seed keywords (wellness, addiction recovery, mental health)
- **Process**:
  - Use Google AI Studio free Gemini API to expand seed keywords
  - Cluster keywords by intent (informational, transactional, local)
  - Filter for low-competition, high-intent terms
  - Output: JSON array of 5 keywords + search volume estimates
- **Note**: Free tier = 2M tokens/month = plenty for 5 posts/week

### Stage 2: Content Generation (WriteSeed Lifetime License)
- **Input**: Keyword data from Stage 1
- **API Call Structure**:
  ```
  POST https://api.writeseed.com/generate
  {
    "title": "[keyword-based title]",
    "topic": "[target keyword]",
    "style": "informational, conversational, no AI fluff",
    "length": "1500-2000 words",
    "include_internal_links": true,
    "target_audience": "wellness/recovery readers"
  }
  ```
- **Output**: Markdown or plain text blog content
- **Prompt Addendum**: "Avoid words: elevate, enhance, top-notch, embrace, leverage. Write like a 23-year registered nurse explaining real solutions."

### Stage 3: HTML Generation & SEO Metadata
- **Input**: Content from Stage 2 + keyword from Stage 1
- **Process**:
  - Convert markdown to HTML
  - Auto-generate meta description (155 chars, include keyword)
  - Create H1 from keyword
  - Add internal links using sitemap reference
  - Add schema markup (Article + BlogPosting)
  - Create slug from keyword (URL-safe)
- **Output**: Complete HTML file ready for GitHub

### Stage 4: GitHub Push
- **Input**: HTML file + metadata
- **Process**:
  - Commit message: "[Keyword] - SEO blog post"
  - Push to `tinglott/artisy-store` repo → new folder `blog/`
  - Update sitemap.xml with new post
  - Trigger GitHub Pages rebuild
- **Output**: Live URL via `raw.githack.com/tinglott/artisy-store/main/blog/[slug].html`

### Stage 5: Distribution Routing
- **Post to OnlySocial** at next 9 AM / 2 PM / 8 PM trigger
  - Headline: Target keyword
  - Body: First 100 words of blog + call to action
  - Link: raw.githack.com blog URL + `?utm_source=onlysocial&utm_medium=social`
- **Add to Pinterest rotation** (next available slot)
- **Track in Google Search Console** (Ting verifies domain ownership)

---

## n8n Free Tier Limits
- **Execution**: 1 workflow per execution node, unlimited triggers
- **Data**: 50MB storage max
- **Frequency**: Can run hourly if needed (n8n free allows it)
- **Integrations**: All tested (Google, GitHub, WriteSeed via HTTP request)

---

## Implementation Checklist

- [ ] Get WriteSeed API key (check account settings)
- [ ] Generate GitHub Personal Access Token (Settings → Developer Settings → Tokens)
- [ ] Set up Google AI Studio project for Gemini API (free, no credit card)
- [ ] Build n8n workflow (drag-and-drop, no code needed)
- [ ] Test with 1 keyword first
- [ ] Create `blog/` folder in GitHub repo
- [ ] Create sitemap.xml template
- [ ] Add raw.githack.com blog link to OnlySocial rotation
- [ ] Verify Google Search Console indexing

