## Expected Outcomes

- **Timeline**: 5 posts in 2 weeks (1 every 3 days)
- **SEO lag**: 2-4 weeks before Google indexes (normal for new domains)
- **Target**: Rank page 1-3 for low-competition keywords within 60 days
- **Traffic**: Conservative estimate 20-50 clicks/month per post by week 8
- **Revenue**: Route to Gumroad landing page (FOMO funnel) + Brevo email sequence

